cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Behavioral Venue Ranking: Emergence-Aware Bipartite Graph Ranking"
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-06-01"
abstract: >
  A research codebase for emergence-aware venue recommendation.
  Introduces the rising-stars evaluation metric (popularity-debiased
  Spearman ρ), anti-loyalty behavioral priors, and a validated
  pipeline across 5 domains (coffee shops, restaurants, hotels,
  London tourists, UK Foursquare check-ins).
authors:
  - family-names: "Liu"
    given-names: "Chris"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/chrisliu/behavioural-venue-ranking"
keywords:
  - recommender-systems
  - bipartite-graph-ranking
  - behavioral-signals
  - venue-recommendation
  - rising-stars-detection
  - emergence-detection
